# Jira XLSX Export Reference

Full openpyxl patterns for generating the 3-sheet styled Jira import workbook.

---

## Workbook Structure

| Sheet | Purpose | Audience |
|-------|---------|---------|
| `Jira Import` | Upload-ready CSV columns | Jira import wizard |
| `Backlog View` | Human-readable backlog | Team / PM review |
| `Summary` | Dashboard — counts, points, phases | Stakeholders |

